From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:48:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 013/131] clk: mediatek: add MT6833 apmixedsys, topckgen and
 infracfg_ao clocks

PLLs follow the MT8192 layout (same block); topckgen/infracfg tables are
generated from the Samsung SM-A226B MT6833 source by
tools/gen-clk-mt6833.py. Enabled on a22x as providers only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
